---
description: Mandatory persistent project-memory workflow
alwaysApply: true
---

Before non-trivial work, read `AGENTS.md`, `.agent-memory/README.md`,
`.agent-memory/current-state.md`, `.agent-memory/current-task.md`,
`.agent-memory/checkpoint.json`, `.agent-memory/handover.md`,
`.agent-memory/open-blockers.md`, `.agent-memory/work-plan.md` and relevant
domain memory.

Inspect code and, when available, Git status and diff. Continue from the
recorded next action. Do not restart verified work. Update project memory when
code, schema, API, security, architecture, progress or verification changes.
Never store secrets or production customer data in memory files.
